{"id":"3a52f6ccd0a0a127","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-consistency-proof.md","title":"GL Consistency Proof","display":"df-gl-consistency-proof — GL Consistency Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-consistency-proof","aliases":["89-df-gl-consistency-proof"],"display":"df-gl-consistency-proof — GL Consistency Proof","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-semantic]]","[[89-df-kripke-semantics-gl]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-consistency-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-consistency-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-consistency-proof — GL Consistency Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f2ee867f14428e3\" href=\"?note=7f2ee867f14428e3\" title=\"89-df-gl-semantic\">89-df-gl-semantic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" href=\"?note=89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" title=\"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl\">89-df-kripke-semantics-gl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> is a set of GL Kripke models and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span> is the relation from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f2ee867f14428e3\" href=\"?note=7f2ee867f14428e3\" title=\"89-df-gl-semantic\">89-df-gl-semantic</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConCert}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\subseteq\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathrm{ConCert}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\)</span> 是下述定义的语义证书集合，参数为给定模型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConCert}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nM\\in\\mathcal U\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\,\n(\\langle M,A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U))\n\\land\n\\langle M,\\bot\\rangle\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConCert}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nM\\in\\mathcal U\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\,\n(\\langle M,A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U))\n\\land\n\\langle M,\\bot\\rangle\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL一致性证明通过反模型实现</li>\n<li>GL一致性证明是 GL 的基本结果</li>\n<li>该集合给出“验证全部 GL 定理但反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>”的语义证书。只要存在一个证书，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 便直接与它矛盾；额外可靠性定理用于从框架语义建立这类证书，而非从已经满足定义的证书再推一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"7f2ee867f14428e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-semantic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl","status":"resolved","id":"89ed9a6623b0dfc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-semantics-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-logic]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"7f2ee867f14428e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U$ is a set of GL Kripke models and\n$\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)$ is the relation from\n[[89-df-gl-semantic]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConCert}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\subseteq\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConCert}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nM\\in\\mathcal U\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\,\n(\\langle M,A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U))\n\\land\n\\langle M,\\bot\\rangle\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-consistency-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","7f2ee867f14428e3","89ed9a6623b0dfc3"]}